stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Boot

    Boot --> WiFiSetupMode: attempt WiFi provisioning

    WiFiSetupMode --> Idle: station connects
    WiFiSetupMode --> IdleNoWiFi: 120s timeout -> SoftAP fallback

    Idle --> TagDetecting: tag presence (1st read)
    IdleNoWiFi --> TagDetecting: tag presence (1st read)
    IdleNoWiFi --> Idle: station WiFi comes up later

    TagDetecting --> Idle: reads don't confirm (false trigger)
    TagDetecting --> TagReadError: 3 reads, inconsistent/corrupt data
    TagDetecting --> BlankTagFound: 3 reads confirm, tag is unformatted
    TagDetecting --> ValidTagFound: 3 reads confirm, valid OPT data found

    TagReadError --> Idle: tag removed

    BlankTagFound --> AwaitingFormatConfirm: prompt shown, 5s countdown starts
    note right of AwaitingFormatConfirm
        Confirm-by-inaction: display shows live
        countdown (5...4...3...2...1).
        LED blinks, accelerating as it counts
        down (distinct pattern, not reused
        elsewhere). Removing the tag during
        the countdown cancels; leaving it in
        place until 0 confirms.
    end note
    AwaitingFormatConfirm --> FormattingAndRegistering: countdown reaches 0, tag still present
    AwaitingFormatConfirm --> Idle: tag removed during countdown (cancelled)
    FormattingAndRegistering --> ValidTagFound: tag formatted (blank, nil UUID)

    ValidTagFound --> Present: blank tag -> mint UUID + local stub record (needs onboarding)
    ValidTagFound --> ForeignTagFound: nfc_id not in the local store (valid data, just unregistered)
    ValidTagFound --> WeighingAndSync: nfc_id matches a known spool

    ForeignTagFound --> RegisteringForeignTag: decode the tag's own Main data (vendor, material, color, weight)
    RegisteringForeignTag --> WeighingAndSync: local record created from the tag's own data
    ForeignTagFound --> Idle: tag removed
    RegisteringForeignTag --> Idle: tag removed mid-registration

    WeighingAndSync --> Present: weigh once; write tag Aux; append a weigh event to the log

    Present --> ReconcilingMainSection: 1s poll detects a local-store edit (web onboarding)
    ReconcilingMainSection --> Present: tag Main rewritten, snapshot updated
    Present --> Idle: tag removed (2 consecutive misses)
